      "revision": "VN-cold-v4",
      "instructions": "One square Cold advertisement. Exactly one supplied official Digiwin logo. Header contains the reviewed THREE-LINE semiconductor ERP/leading supplier Taiwan role line; make it prominently readable at332px feed artwork width (roughly55-65px equivalent on1254 square), not tiny logo-side fine print.200+ is dominant hero but leave space for the denominator and the new advertiser invitation body in THREE readable lines. All reviewed text mandatory, exact Vietnamese diacritics. No extra category, labels, captions, footnotes, card numbers, screens, customer logos or certification seals. Frozen bright white/pale blue/navy tactile brand grammar only, NOT reference props/layout. The scene occupies only the lower quarter and must show a domestic precision-component supplier preparation context, never a fab/OSAT building. HARD EXCLUDE wafer stacks/discs, trays of packaged chips, cleanroom buildings and silicon factory skyline. Blank physical records and small non-electronic industrial precision metal parts only. No printed text/numbers/icons on records, no graphs/gears/chip pictograms, no glowing automatic integration. Headline selection count is the only numeric claim."
